://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f61/f6123b35fa55fa1c2644e7de287c6a69.jpg"}, {"id": 64326, "name": "Постапокалипсис", "slug": "postapokalipsis", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2607, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/7bb/7bbc774e39bfe149dc8d3e6945a102f7.jpg"}, {"id": 49960, "name": "Life Sim", "slug": "life-sim-2", "language": "eng", "games_count": 3257, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/8ba/8ba1178d043aa752838d68b14fffb922.jpg"}, {"id": 568, "name": "Time Management", "slug": "time-management", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2602, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/3ef/3ef39ba4743f7d6ffe1aa586c88d6133.jpg"}, {"id": 13316, "name": "idler", "slug": "idler", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2901, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/6ed/6ed9f124116deafb14c4a53cd078e8e8.jpg"}, {"id": 294, "name": "Gambling", "slug": "gambling", "language": "eng", "games_count": 670, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/116/116ad888b03b30ddd1b8c96b0f15e606.jpg"}, {"id": 59332, "name": "Idle-игра", "slug": "idle-igra", "language": "eng", "games_count": 2804, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/6e4/6e4fb66651c629ad8a471211b975bdeb.jpg"}, {"id": 49968, "name": "Auto Battler", "slug": "auto-battler", "language": "eng", "games_count": 1091, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/games/139/139bd653d9980c906497b1411b7a912f.jpg"}, {"id": 58271, "name": "Автобаттлер", "slug": "avtobattler", "language": "eng", "games_count": 1062, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/8e1/8e140488342e8316bc0f73ae492acc8e.jpg"}], "publishers": [{"id": 4365, "name": "Landfall", "slug": "landfall", "games_count": 16, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f93/f93e62d27608b695088cad83e346643d.jpg"}, {"id": 53415, "name": "Aggro Crab", "slug": "aggro-crab", "games_count": 6, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f93/f93e62d27608b695088cad83e346643d.jpg"}, {"id": 83872, "name": "Three Hands Co", "slug": "three-hands-co", "games_count": 1, "image_background": "https://media.rawg.io/media/screenshots/f93/f93e62d27608b695088cad83e346643d.jpg"}], "esrb_rating": null, "clip": null, "description_raw": "PEAK is a co-op climbing game where the slightest mistake can spell your doom. Either solo or as a group of lost nature scouts, your only hope of rescue from a mysterious island is to scale the mountain at its center. Do you have what it takes to reach the PEAK?WORK TOGETHERNeed a Hand? You’ll need to rely on your friends to have any hope of scaling the mountain, which changes each time you play. Help each other up ledges, or place ropes and climbing spikes to make the way easier for those who come after.CLIMBThe Mountain Takes no Prisoners! Climb through 4 biomes on your way to the PEAK, each with their own life-threatening obstacles. You’ll need to scavenge for questionable food to survive, and manage your injuries carefully - every setback limits your stamina, making it harder to climb.SURVIVEPrepare For the Worst: Discover a variety of helpful survival items, from energy drinks to climbing spikes to the mysterious Anti-Rope. You’ve got no hope of making it to the PEAK unless you press every advantage given to you.A NEW ISLAND EACH DAYThe game's map rotates out every 24 hours! Try out the new layout each day, or give the same island multiple attempts in a day until you conquer it.EARN BADGESA Well-Seasoned Scout: Show off your survival prowess with dozens of badges to earn and cosmetics to unlock.CLIMBING IS BETTER WITH FRIENDSMultiplayer in PEAK is friends-only - invite up to three other scouts through Steam to climb together, or face the mountain alone if you're really brave!FEATURESClimb with a total of 4 friendsCommunicate through proximity chat 4 different biomes to ascend throughA bunch of questionable foodsLots of different climbing itemsCampfires and marshmallowsCharacter customizationOnline co-op and offline single playerGhosts"}